flowchart LR

%% =====================
%% PRIMARY FLOW
%% =====================

U[User / API] --> OP[OnPrem Cassandra\nSOURCE OF TRUTH]

OP --> OK[Return 200 OK after local commit]

OK --> K[Kafka Producer]
K --> KT[Kafka Topic (Partitioned by PK)]
KT --> F[Flink Stream Processing]
F --> AZ[Azure Cassandra TARGET\nUSING TIMESTAMP(source_writetime)]


%% =====================
%% CDC FLOW (SOURCE ONLY)
%% =====================

OP --> CDC0[CommitLog cdc_raw]

CDC0 --> CDC1[CDC Agent]
CDC1 --> CDC2[CDC Kafka Topic]

CDC2 --> RECON[Reconciliation Engine]

RECON --> CMP[Compare writetime / deletes / state]

CMP --> DEC{Divergence?}

DEC -->|Yes| RT[Repair Topic]
RT --> RW[Repair Worker (USING TIMESTAMP)]
RW --> AZ

DEC -->|No| OK2[Metrics Only]
